{"id":"n62674-2-7","stage":4,"title":"서두 · 首位","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62674-2-7-1","ko":"발표 순서를 정해야 하는데 누가 먼저 할래?","zh":"得决定一下演讲的顺序了，谁想先来？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"발표","meaning":"发表，发布","explanation":"발표：发表，发布","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62470","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}},{"text":"순서를","meaning":"次序","explanation":"순서：次序；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"순서","audio":"/audio/ef711cfc76747ee60b55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64563","senseId":"2","lemma":"순서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"순서를","audio":"/audio/115c473b58ec42f06f01.mp3"}},{"text":"정해야","meaning":"定，选定","explanation":"정하다：定，选定；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29767","senseId":"1","lemma":"정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정해야","audio":"/audio/d3aafe4dbdce4b31e6c3.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}},{"text":"할래?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할래","audio":"/audio/18a41bc766488b00a623.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"662fbb8d7bdeae80","term":"발표","zh":"发表，发布","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3","entryId":"62470","definition":"向世人公开并传播某种事实、结果或作品等。","pronunciation":["발표"]},{"id":"ef711cfc76747ee6","term":"순서","zh":"次序","audio":"/audio/ef711cfc76747ee60b55.mp3","entryId":"64563","definition":"做某事或某事实现的顺序。","pronunciation":["순ː서"]},{"id":"2b712f8bfe2006eb","term":"정하다","zh":"定，选定","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3","entryId":"29767","definition":"从几个里面选一个。","pronunciation":["정ː하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"c1ddf2fcaeed84cd","term":"먼저","zh":"先","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3","entryId":"54840","definition":"在时间或顺序上领先。","pronunciation":["먼저"]}],"audio":"/audio/0b06f5aa0022c87a9fc3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62674-2-7-2","ko":"내가 서두로 나설게.","zh":"让我第一个上去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"서두로","meaning":"首位，第一","explanation":"서두：首位，第一；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"서두","audio":"/audio/712d01ec31eb5f6b1d6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62674","senseId":"2","lemma":"서두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서두로","audio":"/audio/ae1d613c9af9d1059856.mp3"}},{"text":"나설게.","meaning":"着手，做起","explanation":"나서다：着手，做起；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나서다","audio":"/audio/d8c0446b0a9a131b1db7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61183","senseId":"2","lemma":"나서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나설게","audio":"/audio/126a4d25d92400efd64b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"712d01ec31eb5f6b","term":"서두","zh":"首位，第一","audio":"/audio/712d01ec31eb5f6b1d6f.mp3","entryId":"62674","definition":"某位次或顺序的最前面。","pronunciation":["서ː두"]},{"id":"d8c0446b0a9a131b","term":"나서다","zh":"着手，做起","audio":"/audio/d8c0446b0a9a131b1db7.mp3","entryId":"61183","definition":"积极地开始做某件事。","pronunciation":["나서다"]}],"audio":"/audio/493e73134139f3fdbe90.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.871,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62674","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6977,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["让我第一个上去吧。","得决定一下演讲的顺序了，谁想先来？","雨一直下，真烦。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["得决定一下演讲的顺序了，谁想先来？","雨一直下，真烦。","让我第一个上去吧。"],"answer":2}]}
